   "end_sec": 22.089,
   "duration_sec": 5.806
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "あ、十一時はみどりセンターですね。パクさん、土曜日の電車は何時ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D006-S01",
    "C11-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 22.439,
   "end_sec": 27.931,
   "duration_sec": 5.492
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "港駅に十二時と十二時半に電車があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D007-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.281,
   "end_sec": 32.084,
   "duration_sec": 3.803
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "十一時半までみどりセンターにいます。十二時に港駅で会いますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D008-S01",
    "C11-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.434,
   "end_sec": 39.2,
   "duration_sec": 6.766
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。十二時半の電車でさくら駅へ行きます。昼ご飯は一時、買い物は二時です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D009-S01",
    "C11-D009-S02",
    "C11-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.55,
   "end_sec": 46.838,
   "duration_sec": 7.288
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "どのスーパーへ行きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D010-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.188,
   "end_sec": 49.057,
   "duration_sec": 1.869
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "駅の前の大きいスーパーです。値段は安いです。スーパーの買い物の予算は千円です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D011-S01",
    "C11-D011-S02",
    "C11-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 49.407,
   "end_sec": 56.016,
   "duration_sec": 6.609
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "何を買いますか。先週のメモもありますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D012-S01",
    "C11-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 56.366,
   "end_sec": 60.339,
   "duration_sec": 3.973
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "これは先週の日曜日のメモです。土曜日に卵とキャベツとジュースと水を買いました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D013-S01",
    "C11-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.689,
   "end_sec": 68.87,
   "duration_sec": 8.181
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "ジュースは二本ですか。魚も買いましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D014-S01",
    "C11-D014-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 69.22,
   "end_sec": 72.656,
   "duration_sec": 3.436
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "いいえ、ジュースは一本です。魚は買いませんでした。高かったです。今週も魚は買いません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D015-S01",
    "C11-D015-S02",
    "C11-D015-S03",
    "C11-D015-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 73.006,
   "end_sec": 79.955,
   "duration_sec": 6.949
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "今週はパンも二つですね。牛乳は？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D016-S01",
    "C11-D016-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 80.305,
   "end_sec": 84.008,
   "duration_sec": 3.703
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "牛乳も欲しいです。二つ買います。パンと牛乳は日曜日の朝ご飯です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D017-S01",
    "C11-D017-S02",
    "C11-D017-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 84.358,
   "end_sec": 90.199,
   "duration_sec": 5.841
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "メニューもありますよ。昼ご飯はどれですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D018-S01",
    "C11-D018-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 90.549,
   "end_sec": 93.604,
   "duration_sec": 3.055
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は魚とご飯です。千百円ですね。ジュースは一杯五百円ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D019-S01",
    "C11-D019-S02",
    "C11-D019-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 93.954,
   "end_sec": 100.994,
   "duration_sec": 7.04
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。一杯五百円です。安くないですね。水もありますよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D020-S01",
    "C11-D020-S02",
    "C11-D020-S03",
    "C11-D020-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 101.344,
   "end_sec": 106.338,
   "duration_sec": 4.994
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "私はパンと牛乳です。二人でその店へ行きます。パクさんも行きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D021-S01",
    "C11-D021-S02",
    "C11-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 106.688,
   "end_sec": 111.563,
   "duration_sec": 4.875
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "いいえ、午後は家で休みます。土曜日は仕事が休みです。午前はみどりセンターで勉強します。週末の宿題は二つですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D022-S01",
    "C11-D022-S02",
    "C11-D022-S03",
    "C11-D022-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 111.913,
   "end_sec": 120.838,
   "duration_sec": 8.925
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。土曜日の夜、家で宿題をします。中村さん、さくら駅の地図を一枚ください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D023-S01",
    "C11-D023-S02",
    "C11-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 121.188,
   "end_sec": 127.273,
   "duration_sec": 6.085
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい、地図です。スーパーはここ、店はその隣です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D024-S01",
    "C11-D024-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 127.623,
   "end_sec": 132.485,
   "duration_sec": 4.862
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C11-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。土曜日は十二時に港駅ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C11-D025-S01",
    "C11-D025-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
